{
  "id": "best-buy",
  "name": "Best Buy",
  "category": "retailer_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "The cards Best Buy in the United States gave away with Pokémon TCG purchases, most of them for an expansion's release and carrying its logo on the picture: Slither Wing for Paradox Rift from 3 November 2023, Xerneas for Mega Evolution from 26 September 2025 and Delphox for the launch of Chaos Rising on 22 May 2026 among them. Several went out in Australia and New Zealand too, at JB Hi-Fi, Mr Toys and Toymate. For the 30th anniversary of Pokémon Best Buy gave Armarouge with the \"What's Your Favorite?\" logo.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Slither Wing (Paradox Rift 107)",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Slither_Wing_(Paradox_Rift_107)#Release_information"
      },
      {
